; budget-close. One with a date only leaves the budget open through its day; one with a time closes it at that time.
; A budget is closed from the month of its first budget-close on. It takes no activity after its close: the first
; posting of each of its accounts after it is reported as BudgetClosed. Its budget-add and budget-transfer still
; count, so what is left can move to another budget. A second budget-close changes nothing, and a budget cannot be
; defined again.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Trip
  budget: Trip
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Hotel
  budget: Trip
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Fun
  budget: Fun

2024-01-01 budget Trip CNY
2024-01-01 budget Fun CNY
2024-01-01 budget Savings CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Trip 1000 CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Fun 100 CNY

2024-02-10 * "Airline" "on the day of a close without a time"
  Expenses:Trip 400 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-10 budget-close Trip

2024-02-11 * "Airline" "the day after the close"
  Expenses:Trip 50 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-12 * "Airline" "after the close again"
  Expenses:Trip 60 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-13 * "Hotel" "another account of the closed budget"
  Expenses:Hotel 70 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-20 budget-add Trip 10 CNY
2024-03-05 budget-transfer Trip Savings 610 CNY

2024-04-01 budget-close Trip
  note: "a second close"

2024-05-01 budget Trip CNY
  note: "defined again"

2024-05-02 * "Airline" "after the definition again"
  Expenses:Trip 5 CNY
  Assets:Bank

; Fun closes at a time
2024-02-15 18:00:00 budget-close Fun

2024-02-15 17:59:59 * "Cinema" "a second before the close"
  Expenses:Fun 20 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-15 18:00:00 * "Cinema" "at the instant of the close"
  Expenses:Fun 30 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-02-15 18:00:01 * "Cinema" "a second after the close"
  Expenses:Fun 40 CNY
  Assets:Bank
